Rename to Meta's Nifty Film Fest Scheduler, move dev to Linux

Title and heading updated.

Development now happens on Linux (WSL): setup.sh builds the virtual
environment, launch.json points at ./.venv/bin/python, and the README's
commands are Linux ones. The MovieLens note is explicit that the dataset has
to be downloaded separately, since it cannot be redistributed.

